Aveap
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
COLUMN 2 FACE_HALF

OKO 3 FACE_HALF
OKO 5 FACE_HALF
OKO 10 FACE_HALF
OKO 3 FACE_HALF
OKO 3 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE OKO COLUMN
AND
    OR
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS}
        SRC Rank 1
    DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK {OKO, COLUMN} COLUMN
OR
    SRCSTACK Suit match
    DEST Suit {DIAMONDS}
$win
OR
    PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
    PILE ALL OKO Empty
